{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12667","headline":"引极三首 思元极 · 元结","name":"引极三首 思元极","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天旷莽兮杳泱茫，气浩浩兮色苍苍。\n上何有兮人不测，积清寥兮成元极。\n彼元极兮灵且异，思一见兮藐难至。\n思不从兮空自伤，心慅𢜱兮意惶懹\n思假翼兮鸾凤，乘长风兮上羾。\n揖元气兮本深实，餐至和兮永终日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}